ean after  all this is a collectible i mean it's  science fiction it's star wars right so  you can't expect costumes and uniforms  to be that comfortable or functional by  definition the fact that everyone's head  size is different  so it kind of varies and you know mine  is big  and you know what else is big  my brain of course you sick  another thing that you might experience  wearing the helmet is that you can't  really see the rangefinder through the  visor's point of view no it doesn't  align with your right eye so you know  technically when you flip this it's  it's kind of in your peripheral vision  it's not really  you know you can't aim things with that  so like i mentioned before some things  are just meant for aesthetics and you  know don't be too  and don't be too heavy said about not  being it fully functional or at least  100 functional so the verdict it's great  i actually love it  and i'm sure role players and cosplayers  will be excited on one too though of  course i wish there could have been more  to be added in terms of function like  perhaps a voice modulator  or even some voice line from the bounty  hunter himself well yeah okay fine i  mean he only had like what four lines in  the movie but  still still  but i digress this is probably one of  the most detailed mass produced helmets  ever  and if you're planning to get one it's  already available now so yeah go get it  really get one please get one and get  one for me too this is not mine get one  for me  so we hope you guys enjoyed the video  for more stunning details and pictures  head over to the link in our description  below like share this video and don't  forget to subscribe if you already  haven't and don't forget to smash that  notification bell icon so you can stay  updated to our latest news and videos  also leave a comment down below tell us  do you like my helmet do you hate it do  you want to get one what do you think  hasbro could have done better until then  see you on the next o